%% A user-defined slide template. style.py (next to this file) registers a
%% `banner` template; a slide selects it with !slide[.banner]. lmr2svg
%% auto-loads style.py:
%%   lmr2svg examples/custom-templates/deck.lmr -o custom.html
!title Custom Templates
!madewith

!slide Regular content slide

This uses the built-in **content** template — left title, accent rule, footer.

!slide[.banner] A banner slide

This slide uses a **custom** template: a full-width accent band with the title reversed out.

- templates are plain Python functions
- selected per-slide with `!slide[.name]`
